<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan president sacks Bhutto, dissolves assembly.</title>
<headline>Pakistan president sacks Bhutto, dissolves assembly.</headline>
<dateline>ISLAMABAD 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistani President Farooq Leghari dissolved the National Assembly (lower house) on Tuesday and sacked Prime Minister Bhutto and her cabinet, the official news agency APP said.</p>
</text>
